      "summaries": {
        "en": "Claw-code is a Rust-based toolkit designed to streamline real-world development workflows by providing efficient harness tools. Its technical distinction lies in leveraging the oh-my-codex framework to optimize code execution and tool integration, making it exceptionally fast and reliable. Developers can use it to automate repetitive coding tasks, enhance build processes, or integrate custom tools, offering a practical way to boost productivity in software projects.",
        "zh": "Claw-code 是一个基于 Rust 的工具包，旨在通过提供高效的 harness 工具来简化实际开发流程。其技术亮点在于利用 oh-my-codex 框架优化代码执行和工具集成，从而实现卓越的速度和可靠性。开发者可用它自动化重复编码任务、改进构建流程或集成自定义工具，为软件项目提供提升生产力的实用方案。",
        "es": "Claw-code is a Rust-based toolkit designed to streamline real-world development workflows by providing efficient harness tools. Its technical distinction lies in leveraging the oh-my-codex framework to optimize code execution and tool integration, making it exceptionally fast and reliable. Developers can use it to automate repetitive coding tasks, enhance build processes, or integrate custom tools, offering a practical way to boost productivity in software projects.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "claw-code gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "Claw-code is a Rust-based toolkit designed to streamline real-world development workflows by providing efficient harness tools. Its technical distinction lies in leveraging the oh-my-codex framework to optimize code execution and tool integration, making it exceptionally fast and reliable. Developers can use it to automate repetitive coding tasks, enhance build processes, or integrate custom tools, offering a practical way to boost productivity in software projects.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/ultraworkers/claw-code for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
